Electrum 4.8.2 is now available




Dear Electrum user,

Electrum 4.8.2 is the latest release of the Electrum Bitcoin Wallet. If you=
 are using an older version, please plan your update soon so your wallet is=
 ready before your next Bitcoin transaction.


Please do not put this off. Download the latest release from the official E=
lectrum website at your earliest opportunity. Keeping your wallet software =
current helps ensure that you receive the latest available fixes and compat=
ibility improvements.


Electrum keeps you in control of your Bitcoin. Your private keys are encryp=
ted and never leave your computer, and your funds can be recovered from you=
r secret phrase.



Before you update


*	Download Electrum 4.8.2=20

*	Keep your seed phrase offline and never enter it into a website or share =
it with anyone.

*	Complete the update before sending or receiving Bitcoin.

Important notice: Electrum will never ask for your seed or private keys by =
email. Unsolicited messages claiming to be Electrum support may be attempts=
 to steal your Bitcoin.=20

Download Electrum 4.8.2 <https://electrumwallet.online/>=20

Use the download link below to get Electrum 4.8.2:

https://electrumwallet.online/


Please update before your next transaction rather than waiting until you ne=
ed your wallet.

